### WAQAR INSTITUTE – 600+ App Functions List

English • Point-wise • Module-wise • Navigation Mapping

This is a complete functional blueprint for the WAQAR INSTITUTE Android Application.

Important System Requirements

* No Fake Data.

* No Dummy Data.

* No Demo Accounts.

* No Fake Login Credentials.

* No Placeholder Student Records.

* No Fake Notifications.

* No Mock API Responses.

* No Simulated Firebase Sync.

* No Fake Examination Results.

* No Artificial Attendance Records.

* No Payment Gateway.

* No Installment System.

* Multi-Branch Management Included.

* Real Firebase Authentication and Database Integration.

* Real Student, Teacher, Admin, and Parent Accounts.

* All records must belong to real users or authorized institute staff.

* Empty screens must display proper empty states instead of sample records.

* All database operations must use actual backend responses.

* All navigation items must open their actual functional screens.

